{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05432","headline":"咏史 · 王丘","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高洁非养正，盛名亦险艰。\n伟哉谢安石，携妓入东山。\n云岩响金奏，空水灧朱颜。\n兰露滋香泽，松风鸣佩环。\n歌声入空尽，舞影到池闲。\n杳眇同天上，繁华非代间。\n卷舒混名迹，纵诞无忧患。\n何必苏门子，冥然闭清关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王丘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}